Chef has to travel to another place. For this, he can avail any one of two cab services.

The first cab service charges x rupees.
The second cab service charges Y rupees.
input
3
30 65
42 42
90 50
output
FIRST
ANY
SECOND
====
t=int(input())
for i in range(t):
    l=list(map(int,input().split()))
    if l[0]<l[1]:
        print("FIRST")
    elif l[0]>l[1]:
        print("SECOND")
    elif l[0]==l[1]:
        print("ANY")

        
